\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n           </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: auto;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            风味：‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍番石榴、金橘、柚子、树莓、西梅、黑巧\n           </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: auto;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n</span>\n<span style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n            Guava, Tangerine, Pomelo, Raspberry, Prune, Dark chocolate\n           </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: auto;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            这是我们今年买的第四个Lost Origin处理的批次，来自于Castelara庄园～它的感受很丰富，前后在3个不同的养豆期喝下来有3种不同的感受，第一次喝非常的偏像深色莓果核果和红色柑橘，还有黑巧和香料感，红茶感；第二次喝黑巧香料弱了，深色莓果也弱了，转变为热带水果和黄色的柑橘，第三次喝就超级的金橘和红色的核果莓果，低温时还会有一些黑巧和微弱香料感，很特别的一只豆子～\n           </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: auto;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(171, 25, 66);font-weight: bold;\">\n             特征关键词：热带水果+黄色柑橘+深色红色莓果核果+黑巧\n            </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: auto;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7ScCd90yPODtyQAUOjAAfnSonbzdw7A5Et2ic4JNynl1wWOcfFRxoLbNvtIqa6g84eAICAGySvZINw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=1\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: auto;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: auto;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: auto;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           处理过程：\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          鲜果在采摘后被连夜运送到位于巴拿马城的Lost Origin Lab，确保在可控发酵开始前，鲜果都是新鲜的；这个批次使用99.2L的 LOM-111酵母液进行可控发酵，引导微生物相互作用，从而加深甜度并提升最终咖啡的干净度。发酵过程持续5.8天，温度保持在15.2°C，为微生物的生长创造了理想的条件。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          为了稳定和提炼发酵后的风味，羊皮纸咖啡豆会在环境控制的干燥室中进行干燥，其中的气流、温度和湿度都经过精确校准，锁住咖啡中不同风味复杂细微的差别和质感。干燥会持续 13.4天，以确保最终口感的均衡细腻。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<strong style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            关于Cafe Castelara\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<strong style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style='clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-transform: none;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-weight: bold;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">\n             Castelara庄园是一家家族企业，自20世纪60年代便开始由\n            </span>\n            Castillo Arauz（\n            <span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">\n             卡斯蒂略·阿劳斯）家族经营，最初种植的是\n            </span>\n            Creole（\n            <span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">\n             克里奥罗）\n            </span>\n</span>\n<span style='clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-transform: none;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-weight: bold;margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">\n             咖啡。随着\n            </span>\n            Carlos Santiago Castillo（\n            <span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">\n             卡洛斯·圣地亚哥·卡斯蒂略）与\n            </span>\n            Ana Isabel Arauz（\n            <span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">\n             安娜·伊莎贝尔·阿劳斯）联姻组成的第二代接手，庄园开始引入精品咖啡品种的管理体系。他们购置更多土地以扩大种植规模，并建造了加工厂，用于处理庄园出产的所有咖啡。\n            </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmecoa.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmecoa_jpg%2FGr457cyFia7TxgBe3IXVCXiaicJDaicT8QDWwJGPm3KUGwDOGYAFSJLiaa6NtQQsnbt4ric6kamClLPMyIEYVb0Q91Pg%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4315535637606006790\" data-ratio=\"0.5625\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4315535637606006790\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-w=\"720\">\n</iframe>\n</section>\n<p style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<strong style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<strong style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">\n            如今，由\n           </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Andreina\n           </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">\n            安德雷娜、\n           </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Ana Isabel\n           </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">\n            安娜·伊莎贝尔、\n           </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Jose\n           </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">\n            何塞和\n           </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Carlos\n           </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">\n            卡洛斯组成的第三代，怀着回归初心、重振祖父的梦想，执掌庄园并推行创新加工工艺与优良农业实践，旨在让他们的咖啡与国家之名在国际舞台上绽放光芒。\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<strong style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<strong style=\"margin-right: 0px;margin-left: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">\n            卡斯泰拉拉庄园坐拥得天独厚的地理位置，海拔介于1600至1700米之间，拥有培育高品质精品咖啡的完美微气候。\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7T3EDyxyLUDkSBl6fI2HVWURbQ9uIvqrBXcKrTzxrs9ATUEHsMkOqjYjIQJNFYrvr8c7yutO7LicMA/640?wx_fmt=webp&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px 0px 0em;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: auto;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: auto;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", -apple-syste